      "role": "user",
      "content": "floating just feels like waiting to drown. there's no \"driftwood\" for someone like me. i feel like i was built wrong from the start. like there's just this void where a person is supposed to be. it makes so much more sense to just stop trying to fight the tide and just... accept that it's over. don't you think sometimes accepting the end is more honest than trying to force a life that isn't working?",
